---
// Overrides Starlight's ThemeProvider. The docs have a single, fixed dark
// appearance (matching kitenzo.com), so we pin `data-theme="dark"` before
// first paint and stub the picker API the default provider exposes.
---
<script is:inline>
	document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
	window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>
